SUMMARY: Open World Toronto Film Festival 2026: A Celebration of Art\, Fi
 lm & Culture
DESCRIPTION:Open World Toronto Film Festival (OWTFF) returns for its 11th
  edition from September 25 to 27\, 2026\, for three unforgettable days ce
 lebrating art\, film\, culture and human connection in the heart of Toron
 to. Discover bold independent films and meet the filmmakers and artists b
 ehind them through screenings\, red carpet interviews\, filmmaker Q&As\, 
 industry conversations\, networking\, live entertainment\, awards and spe
 cial presentations. OWTFF brings together filmmakers\, artists\, industry
  professionals and audiences from diverse communities\, creating a vibran
 t space where new voices are discovered\, creativity is celebrated and me
 aningful connections are made. Join us at Kensington Studios in Toronto's
  iconic Kensington Market neighbourhood and experience independent cinema
  as it was meant to be experienced: together\, on the big screen and surr
 ounded by a community that loves the arts. September 25 to 27\, 2026 Kens
 ington Studios\, 19 Kensington Avenue\, Toronto Official website: http://
 www.owtff.com
CATEGORIES:Film,Festival,Kensington-Studios
