BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Bicycling Network": "https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6738742"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:Saturday Morning Ride: Ashbridges Bay to Jack Goodlad park\, Warde
 n Woods loop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T123000
UID:e77d1b20cd1a62aa2f448bf44f015660@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:The ride starts from the parking lot at Ashbridges Bay (Lakesh
 ore / Northern Dancer Blvd - east of Coxwell)\, goes west through the port
 lands and north up the Don Valley\, using the Bayview Ave path and the Don
  River trail. Then along the Taylor Creek trail to the hydro corridor to K
 ennedy and a coffee/washroom break at Tim Hortons\, The return uses the Wa
 rden Woods trail and back to the lakeshore. The total distance is about 39
