DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nGive yourself 
 a much needed self-care afternoon to slow down\, reconnect with yourself\,
  and have conversations that go a little deeper.\nIf you've been feeling t
 oo online\, too "on" or just too in your head lately\, come spend an after
 noon slowing things down with us.\nWe'll start in the park with soft handp
 an music\, where you'll be guided through a grounding visualization exerci
 se\, journaling\, and intuitive drawing to help you come back o yourself a
 nd notice what's been coming up for you.\nThen\, we'll do head over to a h
 idden café gem nearby. Jessie & Mei from Slow Networking 🦥 will then g
 uide…\n\nHosted by Michelle Hsu\, Jessie Yu & Mei Lai Nghiem
