DESCRIPTION:More info: https://tally.so/r/eqg5MQ\n\nHosted by Socialist
  Project (https://socialistproject.ca)\n\nAll are invited to participate
  in Solidarity is Strength\, an organizing event reflecting on a defining
  chapter of Ontario's history and what lessons we can carry forward to
  fight today’s austerity agenda. The event will include a conversation
  with Paul Kellogg\, as well other labour leaders\, rank and file
  education workers\, and prominent activists.
