DESCRIPTION:Learn how to observe key features such as size\, shape\, color
  patterns\, and unique markings\, as well as listening for characteristic 
 calls and songs. This session provides simple techniques for recognizing b
 irds briefly\, making your birdwatching experience more enjoyable and rewa
 rding\, whether you’re at home or exploring local parks.
