SUMMARY:YUMYUM: September
DTSTART:20260926T220000
DTEND:20260926T220000
UID:2cad251e64e7c26bf84b12f896a16e75@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:YumYum is your home to move\, explore\, and connect. At its he
 art\, this is a dance party—designed for queers to lose themselves in th
 e music\, the space\, and their own desires. While we&#x27\;re proudly sex
 -positive\, this is not exclusively a play party. It’s a space where con
 sent is everything\, and you’re free to express yourself however feels r
 ight—whether that means dancing all night\, lounging with friends\, or e
 mbracing moments of intimacy. From 10 PM to 7 AM\, our multi-room\, multi-
 floor venue transforms into an hazy playground of sound\, movement\, and p
 ossibility. No expectations\, no pressure\, no cameras—just the freedom 
 to be unapologetically you. ‍
LOCATION:Complex19\, 19 Toronto St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/yumyum-september
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
