DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\n🐟 Adventure
  Alert! Witness the Annual Salmon Run at Erindale Park! 🌊🍂\nWho's re
 ady for a refreshing escape into nature? Join us for an easy\, scenic stro
 ll along the beautiful Credit River to witness one of Ontario’s most inc
 redible natural spectacles: the annual Salmon Run! Watch these powerful fi
 sh journey upstream right before your eyes.\n✨ Walk Highlights:\nDuratio
 n: ~2.5 to 3 hours (plenty of time to stop\, watch\, and take photos!)\nDi
 stance: ~5 km\nDifficulty: Beginner-friendly (mostly flat trails\, gentle 
 paths along the river)\nExpect stunning riverside fall foliage\, peaceful 
 wooded paths\,…\n\nHosted by Salaam Spaces
