 24059392/\n\nHosted by Toronto Community Bikeways Coalition
  (https://www.communitybikewaysto.ca/)\n\nA 21 km ride on the Scarborough
  Link to highlight the need to "close the gaps" in this multi-use trail to
  create a continuous\, off-street\, hiking and biking trail to connect
  Scarborough and the rest of Toronto. This will be a family friendly
  recreational ride but all riders should be capable of peddling 21
  kilometres.
