DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T143000
UID:6a999cb060ccaf01c0231d2d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with the National Film Board join us for the s
 creening lm\nWaaPaKe (Tomorrow/Demain)\n\, a powerful 2023 documentary by 
 Dr. Jules Arita Koostachin. The film shares personal stories and explores 
 the lasting impacts of residential schools\, while also looking toward hea
 ling\, hope\, and the future. Come watch\, reflect\, and share in this mea
 ningful experience.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Rm 200\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a999cb060ccaf01c0231d2d
