 tions\nUpon completion of this class students will have a basic understand
 ing of how to create and organize files in the Windows environment.\nPrere
 quisites: Computer for Beginners 1 & 2 or basic mouse and keyboarding skil
 ls\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations\nInformation Collection Notice:\n
 The personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public L
