DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T150000
UID:6a8309b23b6c71003e595e47@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Build on your basic Microsoft Excel skills and learn to use Ex
 cel data effectively.\nIn this third session\, you will:\nUse Conditional 
 Formatting to visualize data\nExplore the power of PivotTables for data su
 mmary and analysis\nSort and filter the data in tables and using slicers\n
 Take home practice data to improve your new skills\nUpon completion of thi
 s class\, you will be able to get more from your data using Pivot tables.\
 nPrerequisites:  Excel Basics 1 and 2 or equivalent knowledge. Basic mouse
  and keyboard skills required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe person
 al information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library und
 er the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The info
 rmation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery an
 d evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information can
  be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 
 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Barbara Frum\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8309b23b6c71003e595e47
