UID:6a8dc7ad4cb69d003e233fb1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Computers for Beginners 2: Use the Keyboard\nA class on basic 
 keyboard functions for absolute beginners with little or no computer exper
 ience.\nIn this second session you will:\nFamiliarize yourself through pra
 ctice with the most essential keyboard functions (alphabet\, number and sy
 mbol keys)\nPractice proper keyboarding posture\nUpon completion of this c
 lass students will be able to use a keyboard at a beginner level and know 
 how to go online for additional practice.\nPrerequisites: Computer for Beg
 inners 1 or basic mouse skills\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
 cted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sectio
 ns 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event 
