 n. 26.\nQuiet\nby Susan Cain\nFeb. 23.\nThe Rosie Project\nby Graeme Simsi
 on\nMar. 23.\nThe Marriage of Opposites\nby Alice Hoffman\nApr. 27.\nThe B
 ook of Eels\nby Patrik Svensson\nMay 25.\nTrust\nby Hernan Diaz\nJun. 22.\
 nReproduction\nby Ian Williams\nJul. 27.\nCrow Lake\nby Mary Lawson\nAug. 
 24.\nUntil August\nby Gabriel Garcia Marquez\nSep. 28.\nNever Let Me Go\nb
 y Kazuo Ishiguro\nOct. 26.\nSay Nothing\nby Patrick Radden Keefe\nNov. 23
 .\nBehind the Beautiful Forevers\nby Katherine Boo\n*Dec. 14.\nMaybe You S
 hould Talk to Someone\nby Lori Gottlieb\n*December 14th is a change from t
 he usual schedule\, to accomodate the holiday season\nInformation Collect
 ion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Tor
