SUMMARY:Leaders Choice: Bread & Butter to Marine Parade and up Bayview
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T113000
UID:7f9b2ee89bbc9fe7ea4ff5e75bb4aada@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Bread & Butter to the Marine Parade and up Bayview A easy roll
 ing city spin starting in midtown\, heading South and a little bit West me
 andering through residential streets over to High Park then down to the la
 ke. Then we’ll head West along the lakeshore\, to Marine Parade drive an
 d the turnaround\, then we’ll head East to the West side of Biidaasigge 
 park\, before heading back up then North up Bayview tackling the gradual y
 et long Bayview hill. Once at the top\, we’ll meander back to the start 
 point at Bread and Butter where you can enjoy lunch if you wish. Ride Star
 t time : 9:30 am (with optional meet at 9:00 am for coffee first) Start an
 d end : Meet at Bread & Butter Cafe \, 507 Mount Pleasant...
LOCATION:Bread & Butter Cafe \, 507 Mount Pleasant Road Route : https://ri
 dewithgps
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6844838
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
END:VEVENT
