 will demonstrate how to make nutritious rice bowls\, based on Asian tradit
 ions.\nCooked ingredients will be prepared in advance. Participants have t
 he option of not using the egg and keeping it strictly vegetarian.\nThis p
 rogram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for 
 teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always avai
 lable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with
  a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a91c43e69166f088b959933
