X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luma Toronto Discover": "https://luma.com/4bpl2yk5"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luma_toronto_discover
SUMMARY:Marge Presents: the bee
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T184500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T213000
UID:evt-NJzqSTxGkrcJh4r@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nWaterworks Food Hall\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nRememb
 er spelling bees? The nerves\, the pressure\, the thrill of nailing a word
  you barely knew you knew? Marge is bringing them back\, but this time wit
 h pals and zero risk of disappointing your fifth grade teacher.\nYour host
  for the evening is local spelling bee aficionado (A-F-I-C-I-O-N-A-D-O) La
 ya Polowin of @thebeeeeeeeeeeeeee\, bringing the chaos\, the comedy\, the 
 correct pronunciations and the sweet prizes. Come solo\, come with a team\
 , or come just to heckle from the sidelines.\nEvery ticket includes a $20 
 gift card to spend at the food hall or bar\, so you're covered for the nig
 ht! If…\n\nHosted by Hi It's Marge
