SUMMARY:Spooky Scavenger Hunt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261031T235959
UID:6aac35cc101eb7003f30e90c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Trick or treat!\nStop by the library to find spooky images hid
 den around the children's area. Find them all and win a fun prize!\nThis p
 rogram is intended for children aged 4 to 12 years\n.
