DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T150000
UID:6aa495dcf9ed2e0038500272@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A class on how to use a mouse for absolute beginners with litt
 le or no computer experience.\nIn this session you will:\nObserve and prac
 tice how to operate a mouse effectively\nUnderstand various mouse pointers
  and cursors\nReview basic keyboard functions\nUse the mouse for basic Win
 dows functions\nUpon completion of this class students will be able to use
  a computer mouse at a basic level and will be able to go online for addit
 ional practice.\nDrop-in program. Space is limited.
LOCATION:Jane/Sheppard
