  how it operates.\nIn this class you will learn about:\nDifferent parts of
  an Apple device\, what an Operating System is\, and how to start your dev
 ice\nNavigating the Apple  home screen\nSettings in Apple\niCloud and devi
 ce storage\nTips for troubleshooting and recommended resources for further
  learning.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on th
 is form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librar
 ies Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be
