DESCRIPTION:Free Workshop in English and Mandarin\nAre you a newcomer in C
 anada? ServiceOntario could provide a wide range of services\, which will
  help you get your driver’s licence\, licence plates\, health card\, Ont
 ario Photo Card\, birth certificate\, and other vital documents and servi
 ces provided by the Government of Ontario.\nIn this workshop\, we aim to l
 et you know how to renew your driver’s licence\, health card\, Ontario 
 Photo Card\, as well as answer your questions.\nIn partnership with Immigr
 ation\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink\nSettlement & Commun
 ity Services & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith
