  & Poster Making\n: Prepare buttons and flyers for the upcoming Tree Candi
 date Election 2026!\nFriday\, October 9th\n-\nDash/Sphero Coding\n: Learn 
 simple programming to move robots and accomplish a task\n.\nFriday\, Octob
 er 16th\n-\nPaper Frog\n: Make an easy paper frog and bring it home.\nFrid
 ay\, October 23rd\n-\nPlus-Plus\n: Plus-Plus is a fun\, simple creative to
 y that stimulates fine mother skills\, creativity\, focus and patience.\nF
 riday\, October 30th\n-\nAga Khan Museum Workshop\n: Aga Khan Museum will 
 present a workshop to celebrate Islamic Heritage Month.\nSnacks are offere
 d during the After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be 
