 hands-on activities designed for\nchildren ages 4-12\n. Take on STEAM chal
 lenges with Keva planks and Feltro\, learn coding basics with Dash and Sph
 ero robots\, explore AI using a silly story and song generator\, and more!
 \nNo registration required.\n***\nAbout this event\nDigital Expo 2026 is a
  dynamic day of learning\, exploration and connection focused on shaping a
  responsible AI future for everyone.\nFeaturing inspiring speakers and int
 eractive exhibits\, as well as hands-on workshops for adults\, kids and te
 ens\, the event explores how emerging technologies are transforming our li
 ves\, communities and civic institutions.\nTogether\, we'll examine the op
 portunities and challenges of AI to foster a more informed\, inclusive and
  empowered digital society that protects Canadians and safeguards democrac
 y.\nCheck out tpl.ca/digitalexpo for more information about the Expo and t
 he workshops.\n***
