SUMMARY:Kids Vote! Tree Storytime & Craft
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T113000
UID:6aaacf9fa433d308573bc370@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun tree themed story time and craft! This 
 program will teach kids all about the tree candidates for this year’s Ki
 ds Vote Weekend where you can vote for the "Tree of the Year".\nFor famili
 es with kids age 4-8.  Drop in.  No registration required.\nToronto's m
 unicipal election takes place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYou
 rVote.TO\nwebsite and the\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about t
 he upcoming election\, access important voter resources\, and discover act
 ivities and interactive library programs for all ages happening at a branc
 h near you.\nThis initiative is made possible by donations to the Toronto 
 Public Library Foundation and is generously supported by the McConnell Fou
 ndation.
