SUMMARY:I Love to SING!
DESCRIPTION:Kids from 8 to 18 are welcome to join this free singing program. Have fun while learning pop tunes\, choreography\, stage presence and more\, from one of Canada’s top vocal teachers. Come once or come for all of the sessions – no experience necessary.
