SUMMARY:AUTUMN ACORNS: Pen and Watercolour Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T160000
UID:6ab135b986d845003117a465@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Embrace the beauty of fall in this painting workshop\, where y
 ou'll learn to create a detailed aco000rn in pen and then add vibrant and 
 fluid watercolour!\nThis seasonal class will guide you through using fine 
 pen techniques and warm\, rich watercolours to capture the essence of fall
 . Whether you're a beginner or an experienced artist\, you'll leave with a
  beautiful piece of art and new skills.\nThis program is for teens and you
 ng adults.
