DESCRIPTION:Explore the world of Python coding and AI in this fun introduc
 tory session. Children will learn basic coding\, develop creative problem-
 solving skills\, and gain foundational understanding of AI\, as they creat
 e their own programs. This program is designed for children ages\n10-12 ye
 ars old\n. Registration required. Please register 1 spot for each child at
 tending the workshop.\n***\nAbout this event\nDigital Expo 2026 is a dynam
 ic day of learning\, exploration and connection focused on shaping a respo
 nsible AI future for everyone.\nFeaturing inspiring speakers and interacti
 ve exhibits\, as well as hands-on workshops for adults\, kids and teens\, 
 the event explores how emerging technologies are transforming our lives\, 
 communities and civic institutions.\nTogether\, we'll examine the opportun
 ities and challenges of AI to foster a more informed\, inclusive and empow
 ered digital society that protects Canadians and safeguards democracy.\nCh
 eck out tpl.ca/digitalexpo for more information about the Expo and the wor
 kshops.\n***\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
