URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/20647/1791136800000
SUMMARY: A World of One Heart – Peace and Sustainability
DESCRIPTION:✨ A Spectacular Cultural Performance Comes to Toronto for the
  First Time! ✨\n\nExperience four cultural performances in Toronto from O
 ctober 2–4\, 2026\, presented as part of the international celebration of
  the 60th Anniversary of Tai Ji Men Qigong Academy.\n\nOffered as a compl
 imentary community cultural initiative and a gift to the community\, thes
 e performances blend qigong\, martial arts\, music\, dance\, and contempo
 rary performing arts to bring timeless wisdom to life through inspiring a
 rtistic storytelling\, celebrating cultural heritage while sharing the un
 iversal values of love\, peace\, and conscience.\n\nTai Ji Men’s internat
 ionally acclaimed cultural performances have been presented at renowned v
 enues around the world\, including the Sydney Opera House (Australia)\, P
 asadena Civic Auditorium (USA)\, and Luckman Fine Arts Complex (USA). We 
 are delighted to bring this inspiring cultural experience to Toronto for 
 the very first time.\n\nThe performances are presented by Tai Ji Men (Can
 ada)\, an independent Canadian non-profit organization committed to enric
 hing communities through holistic education\, cultural exchange\, and wel
 l-being initiatives.\n\n🎭 Performance Venues:\n\nSt. Lawrence Centre for
  the Arts — 27 Front St E\, Toronto\, ON\, M5E 1B4\n\n• October 2–3: Jane
  Mallett Theatre\n\n• October 4: Bluma Appel Theatre\n\n🎟 Complimentary 
 Tickets\n\nComplimentary tickets are available by advance reservation. Se
 ating is limited\, so we encourage you to reserve early.\n\n🔗 Reserve yo
 ur tickets: https://tickets.taijimen.ca/ https://tickets.taijimen.ca/\n\n
 📞 Contact Us\n\nFor more information or to arrange group reservations\, 
 please contact us:\n\nPhone: 437-873-2446 / 437-875-4910\n\nEmail: info@t
 aijimen.ca mailto:info@taijimen.ca\n\n#TaiJiMen #TorontoEvents #TorontoCu
 lture #ThingsToDoToronto #FreeEvents #CulturalPerformance #Qigong #Martia
 lArts #LoveAndPeace
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Bluma-Appel-Theatre
