 ay actions can create positive change and lead to a bright future\, brough
 t to life with storytelling\, immersive visuals\, interactive quizzes\, an
 d some unexpected surprises!\nRegistration begins one month before program
  date. For ages 6 - 12.\nFor all registered Children's programs at Malvern
 \, there is a grace period of 10 minutes. After the first 10 minutes of a 
 program\, spots will be given to waiting customers.\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
