DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of tree themed crafts where we will b
 e exploring "Tree of the Year" candidates as they relate to the Kids Vote 
 Weekend. In this event\, we will learn about elections\, understand the im
 pact of voting\, and children are welcome to start their journey to becomi
 ng lifelong voters.\nCheck out\nKids Vote Weekend\n(KVW)\, a fun event hos
 ted by Toronto Elections.\nDrop-in. Limited capacity.\nToronto's municipal
  election takes place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO
 \nwebsite and the\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about the upcom
 ing election\, access important voter resources\, and discover activities 
 and interactive library programs for all ages happening at a branch near y
 ou\nThis initiative is made possible by donations to the Toronto Public Li
 brary Foundation and is generously supported by the McConnell Foundation
