DESCRIPTION:Steps to Learning is a preschool program funded by the United 
 Way. This school readiness program is designed to ease families and their 
 children into the school system successfully. Using a comprehensive intera
 ctive play based method\, families and their children will benefit and enj
 oy success. The program ensures the following six developmental areas\; in
 dependence skills\, self-help skills\, cognitive development\, reasoning\,
  social interaction and language development are included in the curriculu
