SUMMARY:GTApreneurs October 7-2026 Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/networ
 king-events-toronto\n\nJoin us for a vibrant Business Networking Event in 
