 Y:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:15pm:** Presentatio
 ns\n* **7:15-8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and beverages prov
 ided.\n\n**TICKETS:**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega 
 Networking Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $22 in advance or $25 on even
 t day\n***\\*Includes a Guest Contact Sheet*** emailed to you the day afte
 r the event. Note: You need to attend the event to receive the sheet.\n\n*
 *HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President of GTApreneurs\nLearn more about Ta
 mmy’s Coaching services at www.gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto
 \n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?** Call 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapren
 eurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Gwladys Ilfix\,** Vacation Consultant at Expedia Crui
 ses\n\n**CONTACT Gwladys:**\ngilfix@expediacruises\\.com \\| [www.expediac
 ruises.com/eastyork](www.expediacruises.com/eastyork)\n\nView all of GTApr
 eneurs events and services at www.gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe look forward to se
 eing you there!
