DESCRIPTION:Meet the fall 2026 Career Coaches in Residence Sangeetha Diks
 hit\, Wafa Oubella\, Jermaine L Murray and Selena Armstrong!\nFind out m
 ore about what a career coach can offer for your professional journey. Waf
 a\, Jermaine\, Selena and Sangeetha will introduce themselves and discus
