DESCRIPTION:The Lillian H Smith branch and its neighbourhood is home to a 
 variety of trees. Join the\nCity of Toronto Urban Forestry\nteam\nto explo
 re the natural world on a local neighbourhood tour. Learn how to recognize
  different species and fun facts about their cultural and ecological impor
 tance.\nChildren under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver.\nThis
  program is part of TPL's\nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram series\, supported 
 by Friends of Toronto Public Library\, South Chapter.​\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
 0(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program 
