 h little or no computer experience.\nIn this session you will:\nFamiliariz
 e yourself through practice with the most essential keyboard functions (al
 phabet\, number and symbol keys)\nPractice proper keyboarding posture\nUpo
 n completion of this class students will be able to use a keyboard at a be
 ginner level and know how to go online for additional practice.\nPrerequis
 ites: Computer for Beginners - Use The Mouse or basic mouse skills\nFormat
 : Hands-on with demonstrations.\nNo registration required. Drop-in program
 . Space is limited.
