X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaa9d76f5c6780c7048db34"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_adults
SUMMARY:LSP: Origami - Paper Folding Art Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T120000
UID:6aaa9d76f5c6780c7048db34@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you new to Canada? Would you like to say “thank you” t
 o someone special during Thanksgiving Day?\nJoin us to create your own ha
 ndmade gifts\, make new friends\, and learn new skills!\nThis workshop is
  perfect for beginners who want to learn the basics of paper folding art.
 \nThe workshop will be in English and Mandarin.\nIn partnership with Immig
 ration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink Settlement & Commu
 nity Services & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaa9d76f5c6780c7048db34
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
