 y little notebook that you can decorate with stickers\, dried flower decou
 page\, paint\, and markers. Get creative\, then get organized!\nOther acti
 vities\, such as colouring and board games\, are always available at our F
 riday Crafts sessions. Come have fun and meet some new people from your co
 mmunity!\nDrop in.
