DESCRIPTION:Learn about personal color analysis with Jojo\, the founder o
 f We11 Color\, a Toronto-based personal color analysis studio. She special
 izes in helping individuals discover the colors that best complement their
  natural features\, empowering them to make confident choices in fashion\,
  beauty\, and personal style. In this session\, Jojo will introduce the fu
 ndamentals of personal color analysis and share how understanding your bes
 t colors can simplify everyday styling and enhance self-confidence.\nPleas
 e note this program will be a\ngeneral overview\nof the topic and\nnot\na 
 personal color analysis session.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
 onal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library u
 nder the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The in
 formation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery 
 and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information c
 an be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\
 , 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85f38957c264087ad23eb2
