DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Democracy-Themed Storytime and learn about Kids 
 Vote Weekend! Stories and activities in this Storytime will introduce chil
 dren to the foundations of democracy\, elections\, and voting. This is a d
 rop-in program\; no registration is required.\nCheck out\nKids Vote Weeken
 d\n(KVW)\, a fun event hosted by Toronto Elections.\nToronto's municipal e
 lection takes place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\n
 website and the\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about the upcomin
 g election\, access important voter resources\, and discover more activiti
