 P & Advance Tickets https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/sunday-service-th
 anksgiving-famjam-extended-event/\nDo You Know Who I Am? (FREE Entry befo
 re 10pm)\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\nPut on your Sunday best\, sip your tips\, o
 r ride that bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset your week at W
 iggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\n\nEvery funky Sunday funday\, 
 at your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on.soun
 dcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry 
 before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm ~ $6 Vodka & Beer specials before 11pm
