 vance Tickets:\nDo You Know Who I Am? (FREE Entry before 10pm)\nThe Wiggl
 er: $30\n\nPerformers:\n8-9 Paolo\n9-10 Dick Diamonds & Wiley Coyote\n10-
 11 Barroness\n11-12 Tyler Hill\n12-1 Miz Megs\n1-2 TAKiN\n2-3 DAVID HERRE
 RO [Bday]\n3-4 Manzone & Strong\n4-5 3Roc & Nour [bday]\n5-close Don_Tay\
