DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nHow could we b
 uild a Better Toronto?\nOn October 28th\, every Torontonian will have the 
 opportunity to express who they believe has the platform for a bolder city
  in the Toronto municipal election.\nJoin Build Canada & feature speakers 
 as they discuss what they want to see from municipal candidates including 
 transportation\, housing\, and safety.\nYou can see those ideas here: http
 s://buildcanada.com/toronto/memos\nSpeakers will include:\nLucy Hargreaves
 \, CEO & Co-Founder of Build Canada\nAdrian Rocca\, CEO & Founder at Fitzr
 ovia\nEric Richmond\, Country Director / CEO at Coinbase Canada\nAbout Bui
 ld…\n\nHosted by Zander Fraser & Lucy Hargreaves
