DESCRIPTION:The Orchid is now the world’s MOST popular houseplant. Facil
 itated by a Toronto Master Gardener\, learn fascinating stories\, fun fact
 s and tips on orchid care. Love them already but yours don’t bloom? Don
 ’t fret! We have answers. Have disease and pest problems? We help you so
 lve them. Plus\, the best orchids to grow in your home. Suitable for garde
 ners of any skill level.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal inf
 ormation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the
  Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informatio
 n will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and eval
 uation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be di
