SUMMARY:Open Ended: A Storytelling Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T220000
UID:evt-LbOOxlKCKUQHoch@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCassette\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSome stories are b
 etter when they’re left unfinished.\nOpen Ended is a facilitated storyte
 lling night where cliffhangers\, messy moments\, and unbelievable stories 
 take centre stage. Throughout the evening\, guests will be invited to shar
 e short stories that end on a cliffhanger — the kind that leaves everyon
 e leaning in\, asking\, “wait… what happened next?”\nThe night blend
 s a relaxed open mic with table conversation. Each table will receive prom
 pts and story cards to spark conversation\, encourage connection\, and get
  the storytelling flowing among friends (and future friends).\nBetween ope
 n mic…\n\nHosted by Fifth Edit TO
LOCATION:Cassette\, 1214 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1J6\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/rhym8a3o
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
