 . In this workshop\, newcomers will develop their Vision\, Mission\, and V
 alues (VMV) to shape their brand identity and guide business decisions in 
 a new environment. By the end of the session\, participants will understan
 d the importance of VMV and how these core elements influence and align bu
 siness strategies\, ensuring long-term success.\nThis program is part of S
 mall Business Month and the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initiative.
