 intelligence using the MBOT 2. We will be programming a robot using block 
 text code to read in real life inputs and make decisions based on the trai
 ning data we've fed into it. No prior experience is necessary.\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected b
