DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :)\n\nTickets: ~~ TICKETS ~~ https
 ://buytickets.at/wigglyevents/2435189\n\nFeaturing Netherland's most infa
 mous veteran SANDER KLEINENBERG making his Wiggle Room debut. He plays th
 e most bounciest house music that have you dancing your boots off.\n\nPut
  on your Sunday best\, sip your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a
  late check-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly
  Social.\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nEvery funky S
