 6ce68f57cb/6aad9f2aca995fa8efdf4dea/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:How should Canada respond when the old rules no long
 er apply? Acclaimed journalist and former deputy prime minister Chrystia 
 Freeland joins Star business...
LOCATION:Soulpepper Theatre\,50 Tank House Lane\, Toronto\, ON M5A 3C4\, 
