X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Bicycling Network": "https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6842894"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:Wednesday Wheelie - Inglewood to Erin 70 km
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261021T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261021T120000
UID:d44cbda6b013f82b4f7786f1482a7008@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Please note ride starts at 10:00AM! We want to thank the Progr
 am X ride coordinator for this ride. This ride starts in Inglewood\, just 
 off of Hwy 10 and continues towards Caledon East on the Caledon Trailway a
 nd crosses Hwy 10 on the pedestrian bridge over the highway. Then a bit of
  escarpment country and a short stretch of gravel on Escarpment Sideroad a
 s we head west\, skirting past Belfountain on the way to lunch at the Tin 
 Roof Cafe in Erin. Dipping southwards\, we pass through Cheltenham\, then 
 take Boston Mills Rd back to Inglewood. Please note that 33% of the distan
 ce is gravel roads or rail trails. Start location: Lloyd Wilson Centennial
  Arena in Inglewood. If this parking lot is full\,...
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6842894
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
