BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Tool Library": "https://ttlmarket.com/products/in-depth-intro-to-woodworking-oct-22-thursdays-6-week-intensive"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_tool_library
SUMMARY:In-Depth Intro to Woodworking Oct 22 [Thursdays - 6 week Intensive
 ]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T130000
UID:ttl-11093112160449@ttlmarket.com
DESCRIPTION:Woodworking at TTLMakerspace\n\n \n Suitable for beginners\, t
 his woodworking course is designed to teach you all that you need to get s
 tarted in woodworking by learning both traditional\, and modern techniques
 .\n\n Students will learn valuable hands-on skills working on instructor-l
 ead projects using both hand and power tools.\n\n Projects are chosen to p
 rovide skills development in a natural progression from familiarity with t
 he unique characteristics of wood\, to basic essential techniques\, to som
 e more advanced topics.\n\n Materials and equipment for all projects are p
 rovided with the course. \n\n \n\n Schedule : \n\n Six three-hour weekly c
 lasses\, Thursdays 10am to 1pm. \n\n Outcomes : \n\n At the end of this c
 ourse you will have achieved the following goals: \n\n \n- A complete unde
 rstanding of the nature and properties of wood \n\n- Proficiency with trad
 itional woodworking techniques\n\n- Comfort working with chisels\, planes\
 , saws\n\n- Proficiency with wood milling techniques\n\n- Comfort with sa
 fe operation of power tools\n\n- Familiarity with power planing\, joiner\,
  drill press\, router and table saw \n\n- Dressing and laminating wood \n\
 n- Experience following project plans \n\n- Familiarity with joinery \n\n
 - Wood finishing\, various treatments \n\n \n  Following this course\, yo
 u'll be certified to use the woodshop. And you'll be able to join the grow
 ing community of TTL Makers sharing knowledge on our Discord community.\n\
 n Certifications for all courses are valid for one year from the time that
  they are issued\, and can be renewed at no cost with your active monthly 
 membership within 3 months of their expiry. Certification renewal requires
  booking with an instructor\, is conducted at the makerspace\, and helps y
 ou keep your skills current. \n\nUseful for: furniture\, cabinets\, organ
 isers\, cutting-boards \n \n \n \n Want to get notified next time classes 
 are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list!
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/in-depth-intro-to-woodworking-oct-22-th
 ursdays-6-week-intensive
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
END:VEVENT
