UID:6aadbd4d4ea230006f349502@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A class on using Google's filters\, tools\, and Maps for absol
 ute beginners with little computer experience.\nIn this session you will:\
 nUse Google search tools more effectively to find websites\, images\, and 
 news sites\nExplore Google Maps to find addresses and get directions for t
 ransit and road travel.\nUpon completion of this class students will be ab
 le to use more advanced search engine features and use Google Maps at a ba
 sic level.\nPrerequisites: Computers for Beginners - Use the mouse\, keybo
 ard & internet or basic mouse\, keyboarding and internet skills\nFormat: 
 Hands-on with demonstrations.\nDrop-in program. Space is limited.
