SUMMARY:Afternoon Movie - Ghost Busters Frozen Empire
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T170000
UID:6ab59989001a4a0e055bddc4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get into the Halloween spirit this October with our Thursday M
 ovie Afternoons at the branch! Each week\, we'll be screening a fun Hallow
 een-themed film perfect for getting you into the seasonal mood.  Bring you
 r friends\, settle in with fellow movie lovers\, and escape into a world o
