DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T193000
UID:6aaebf27d6577100383d8cc7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto-based Celtic fiddle & guitar instrumental duo\, Alana 
 and Leigh Cline\, will perform various Celtic fiddle tunes and share the h
 istorical background of the music and its genres. The set will include the
  Canadian genres from Newfoundland\, Quebec\, and the Ottawa Valley\, with
  a focus on the music of Cape Breton\, Scotland\, and Ireland.\nSpace/seat
 ing is limited. Please arrive early to secure a spot.
