SUMMARY:Bone Health 101: Strong Bone for Senior (session 2)骨骼健康101
 ：強健骨骼，健康生活
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T150000
UID:6aa186813dd190003e70b6d4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that 1 in 3 women and 1 in 5 men will experience 
 an osteoporosis-related fracture in their lifetime? Join a trained volunte
 er from Osteoporosis Canada to learn how to keep your bones healthy\, redu
 ce your risk of fractures\, and prevent falls through healthy lifestyle ch
 oices.\nThe second session focuses on the physical activities and fall pre
 vention.\nProgram presented in\nEnglish and Chinese\n.\n您知道嗎？每
 \n3\n位女性和每\n5\n位男性中，就有\n1\n人可能在一生中
 發生骨質疏鬆相關骨折。歡迎參加由加拿大骨質疏鬆症
 協會義工帶來的講座，了解如何保持骨骼健康、預防骨
 折及跌倒，並學習健康生活方式的重要知識。\n第二場課
 程：重點介紹運動與預防跌倒
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa186813dd190003e70b6d4
