SUMMARY:Mason Jar Lantern Crafternoon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T150000
UID:6aad814eca248a002916c82c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a crafternoon for adults! Paint a mini mason jar a
 nd put a battery tea light inside to make your own lantern! Supplies will 
