 tion using our in-house laser cutting service. \n\n \n \n \n Schedule : \n
  \n \n Workshop\, Sunday October 25\,  1pm - 4pm (3 hours) \n \n \n \n \n
  \n \n Outcomes : \n \n \n This is a very hands-on workshop: \n \n \n- \n 
 Beginner friendly and instructor-lead \n\n- \n Computer workstation provid
 ed \n\n- \n Guided use of laser-cutter \n\n- \n \n Materials Provided \n \
 n\n \n At the end of the workshop\, you'll have your very own mini-arcade 
 cabinet that you can slide your phone into! \n\n Please note: Workshops ne
 ed to start on time - any no-shows will be given away to anyone in attenda
