BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Tool Library": "https://ttlmarket.com/products/woodworking-level-2-oct-27-tuesdays-6-week-comprehensive"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_tool_library
SUMMARY:Woodworking Level 2 Oct 27 [Tuesdays - 6 week Comprehensive]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T130000
UID:ttl-11093099577537@ttlmarket.com
DESCRIPTION:Woodworking Level 2 at TTLMakerspace\n\n \n \n Note: This cour
 se requires previous completion of Intro to Woodworking\n\n In this course
  at TTLMakerspace\, you will use and expand upon the skills learned in Int
 ro Woodworking. Working in a small group with dedicated instructor\, you'l
 l expand your skills in two practical box-building projects designed to de
 velop deeper understanding of woodworking.\n\n In this followup to Woodwor
 king Intro students advance their skills into more sophisticated use of bo
 th power tools and hand tools. During the course two projects are created 
 that reveal techniques for creating mitred joints\, splines\, inlays\, lap
  joints\, and finishing techniques.\n\n Build up confidence in the shop an
 d learn new\, valuable woodworking techniques.\n\n \n Materials and equipm
 ent for all projects are provided with the course. \n\n Schedule : \n\n Si
 x three-hour weekly classes\, Tuesdays 10am to 1pm. \n\n Outcomes : \n\n A
 t the end of this course you will have achieved the following goals: \n\n 
 \n- Become more comfortable milling rough lumber \n\n- Complete mitered co
 rners \n\n- Complete box joints \n\n- Use a spline jig \n\n- Complete inla
 ys \n\n- Install hinges \n\n- Apply finishes \n\n- Learn how to plan proje
 cts efficiently with minimal waste \n\n \n Following this course\, you'll 
 be certified to use the woodshop. And you'll be able to join the growing c
 ommunity of TTL Makers sharing knowledge on our Discord community.\n\nUsef
 ul for: furniture\, cabinets\, organisers\, cutting-boards \n \n \n \n Wan
 t to get notified next time classes are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list
 !
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/woodworking-level-2-oct-27-tuesdays-6-w
 eek-comprehensive
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
END:VEVENT
