 o their business\, or something fun to share before we hop back on the bik
 es. Expect an easy-paced ride of approximately 40 km \, with multiple trea
 t stops along the way. The route is still being finalized\, but we’re pl
 anning a fun city-focused ride that everyone can enjoy. We’ll wrap up wi
 th more treats and some social time at the finish at a downtown location C
 ostumes are encouraged but completely optional. There will be photos — s
 o if you’re dressing up\, you might as well go all out! Come...
