 akeshore. A coffee break at Leslie/Lakeshore will note this as our last Sa
 turday Morning Ride of the 2026 season!! Then back to Victoria Park by mos
 tly quiet streets. About 31kms- should finish about 12:30 to 1pm. This is 
 an Urban Roller level ride. If you are uncertain whether this level is app
 ropriate to your riding level\, click here . RWGPS link to route: Click he
