SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nIt's a Halloween Dance Party 
 and Scavenger Hunt!\n\nParty Details\n\n* **Theme**: Unmask your hidden se
 lf.\n* **Vibe**: Grown-up drinks\, killer costumes\, and zero filters.\n\n
 **Drop the mask and let your true monster out to play this Halloween.**\nP
 rize for best costume!\nEvery day we wear the mask of the professional\, t
 he polite\, and the responsible. Not tonight. This Halloween\, it’s time
  to shed your civilized skin and unleash your **real personality**—no fi
 lters\, no judgements\, just pure\, unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *a
 ctually* are on the inside.\n🖤 The Ritual\n\n* **Date:** Saturday\, Oct
 ober 31st\, 2026\n* **Time:** 7:00 PM until the spirits fade\n* **Lair: We
  are just confirming the venue. We will keep you posted!**\n\n🍷 The Ele
 ments\n\n* **Potions & Brews:** Drinks and nibbles provided!\n* **Attire:*
 * Costumes required. Dress as your inner alter-ego\, your deepest obsessio
 n\, or the version of you that only comes out after dark.\n* **The Vibe:**
  Dark beats\, heavy pours\, and wicked company.\nADMISSION IS $20\,\n\nAre
  you brave enough to show your true colours?\n\n***
