X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_experiencetoronto
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Experience Toronto
UID:event_316504397@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045636Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T210000
SUMMARY:Free - Soundstreams Violins Unbound (Broadview Ave)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you n
 eed to register for your free admission to this concert.**\n\nOn **Monday 
 November 2nd\, attend** **Violins Unbound** **for TD Encounters Soundstrea
 ms.** Few instruments can match the violin’s extraordinary combination o
 f brilliance\, agility\, and expressive power. This Encounters event will 
 showcase all that the violin can offer\, featuring violinists **Judith Fli
 edl**\, visiting from Austria on a Canadian tour\, and Toronto-based violi
 nist **Roan Ma**\, performing a world premiere for violin duet by **André
  Ristic**\, commissioned by Soundstreams. The program will also include wo
 rks by **John Beckwith**\, **Chris Paul Harman**\, **Parisa Sabet**\, **An
 a Sokolović**. A discussion and audience Q&A with Fliedl and Ma will foll
 ow the performance. **Register for your free admission to Violins Unbound*
 * **for TD Encounters Soundstream on Monday November 2nd at 7:30pm.**\n\n*
 *COST**\nTicket: Free\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* *
 *RSVP Yes**\n* **[Register](https://soundstreams.ca/events/td-encounters-v
 iolins-unbound-2/)\, post you have registered for free admission**\, and I
  will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my
  cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days p
 rior hoping there are still spots available. The Waitlist will be removed 
 at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future att
 endance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7pm inside Hugh's Room at 296 B
 roadview Ave.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 1 - 2 hours\n\nAfter: meet
  at the same spot to chat about the show\n\nEnjoy and please post your com
 ments in the Event after.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/316504397/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260910T201345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T201345Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85e126f564ef0d72c0f1f8"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Quick and Healthy Meal Prep to Simplify Your Life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T200000
UID:6a85e126f564ef0d72c0f1f8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn a new recipe and how to put together a healthy\, homemad
 e meal. Chef Carolina will provide food and nutrition insights\, and demon
 strate how anyone can effortlessly put a meal together\, how to meal plan 
 to save time and money\, and have a nutritionally balanced diet. This prog
 ram will be a demonstration of food preparation and assembly of pre-cooked
  items into a completed dish.  No actual oven or stovetop cooking will be 
 taking place during the program.\nFood allergy notice\n: Please be aware t
 hat food will be used in this program. Food products used in this program 
 may contain or may have come into contact with common allergens. (*Contain
 s dairy\, sugar\, and caffeine)\n*Registration Required. Space is limited.
 \nRegister online or call 416-396-8872.\nRegistration opens October 5\, 20
 26\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this fo
 rm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries A
 ct\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used
  for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions a
 bout how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerlin
 e staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto O
 N M4W 2G8
LOCATION:Guildwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85e126f564ef0d72c0f1f8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
