UID:6aaad603ab7a8e0037c241bb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Why is the #1 skill that will help you thrive as a newcomer en
 trepreneur networking? This workshop with Entrepreneur in Residence (Newco
 mer Focus)\, Jean Chow\, will show you how to build your networking skill
 s and help you achieve your professional and personal goals. Learn the tru
 e meaning of networking and why it’s not what you know and it’s not wh
 o you know.\nIn this session:\nGet outside your comfort zone and grow your
  confidence in meeting new people.\nEmploy strategies to network effective
 ly both in-person and on-line.\nGain a better understanding of how network
 ing can help you grow your business.\nCome early to network from 6-6:30pm!
 \nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is
