SUMMARY:Be Ready\, Toronto! Emergency Preparedness Workshop for Individual
 s
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T140000
UID:6ab6913c3dd190003e7487d2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Emergencies can happen anywhere at any time. In Canada\, we fa
 ce numerous hazards\, including wildfires\, flooding\, heatwaves\, and ear
 thquakes. The Be Ready workshop aims to raise individual and household eme
 rgency preparedness.\nDrop-in\; no registration required. For more informa
 tion\, contact the Downsview branch at 416-395-5720 or go to www.tpl.ca/lo
 cations/DO.
LOCATION:Downsview\, Lower Level Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab6913c3dd190003e7487d2
