 our move!\nRegistration required.\nFor more information or to register\, p
 lease contact Don Mills at 416-395-5710.\nInformation Collection Notice:\
 nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public 
 Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d
