DESCRIPTION:WELCOME TO THE 007 KIKI BALL 1 Agents\, listen up - the briefi
 ng’s simple. Tonight\, we move solo. No team\, no backup\, no safety net
 . The houses will always be home\, but tonight the spotlight belongs to th
 e spies - the baddies\, the bold ones\, the ones who know their confidence
  is the most dangerous weapon in the room. Remember: in this game\, it’s
  not about who stands beside you — it’s about who can stand alone and 
 still make the mission look effortless. If it wasn’t clear enough: NO CA
 TEGORIES CAN BE TAKEN AS A HOUSE $25 - CASH ONLY ‍
