SUMMARY:Creative Connections: Activities for Creative & Social Connections
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T113000
UID:6ab7053e31e9a41a0fbc947c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for creative group activities that support mental well
 ness\, social connection and a sense of belonging. Enjoy music\, movement\
 , mindfulness and more while connecting with others and engaging with your
  community.\nDrop-in\, no registration is required.\nSnacks and refreshmen
 ts are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available
  at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nCanadian Mental H
 ealth Association Toronto\n.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room\, Basement Level
