DESCRIPTION:Come join us on the 2nd Tuesday of the month as we try out new
  titles and discuss in a friendly atmosphere. Drop In. No Registration Req
 uired.\nSept 8 The Adversary by Michael Crummey\nOct 13  The Museum Of Ex
 traordinary Things By Alice Hoffman\nNov 10  The Massey Murders  By Char
 lotte Grey\nDec 8 The Women  By Kristin Hannah
