 6ce68f57cb/6aad9f62ca995fa8efe0fba0/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:When the government came for their neighbours\, an e
 ntire community stood in the way. A new monthly series in partnership wit
 h Hot Docs\, bringing visionary...
LOCATION:Soulpepper Theatre\,50 Tank House Lane\, Toronto\, ON M5A 3C4\, 
 Canada
