DESCRIPTION:Develop and exercise the skills you need to be an active parti
 cipant in everyday democracy in this fun\, interactive session. Democracy
  Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by exploring the s
 kills that help people participate in civic life\, build understanding and
  work together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise our\nVerbal Confidence
 \nmuscles. In a democracy\, we all have a voice. If your voice is warm and
  you know what to say\, your words can make an impact.\nThis program is fo
 r\nadults\,\nplease register for email reminders\, drop-in's are welcome.\
 nThis program is offered in partnership with Democracy Fitness Global and 
 MASS LBP.\nGenerously supported by McConnell Foundation.\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
