DESCRIPTION:Ballet 101 introduces teens to the fundamentals of ballet thro
 ugh performance demonstrations\, discussion\, and guided participation.  
 Participants will explore introductory movements and experience the joy of
  dance in an engaging\, hands-on environment.  For over 35 years\, Jörge
 n Dance has brought professional ballet and dance education to communities
  across Canada\, while supporting the growth of Canadian choreography.
