SUMMARY:Protect Yourself from Financial Scams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T143000
UID:6aaabe12129d8e0031f2adc7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A representative from the\nCanada Revenue Agency (CRA)\nwill d
 iscuss how to recognize scams and fraud\, the different methods used by sc
 ammers\, how to protect your personal and financial information\, and what
  steps to take if you believe you have been targeted.\nRegistration encour
 aged\n. Drop-ins are welcome until capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 1\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaabe12129d8e0031f2adc7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
