SUMMARY:Print from the Pack: Recycled Packaging Printmaking
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T153000
UID:6ab68a9008693b0f73748a83@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A fun introduction to printmaking using discarded packaging! P
 articipants will transform cleaned Tetra Pak cartons into simple printing 
 plates\, then experiment with drawing\, texture to create their own handma
 de prints. A creative way to discover printmaking while giving everyday ma
 terials a new life without using expensive or specialized materials. All m
 aterials are provided.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Main floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab68a9008693b0f73748a83
