DESCRIPTION:Ready to turn your ideas into something people can’t ignore?
  This workshop helps participants develop effective pitching skills by exp
 loring storytelling as a persuasive tool\, crafting compelling narratives\
 , and delivering impactful elevator pitches that leave a lasting impressio
 n.\nRegistration required. Limited spots. Young Adults (ages 18-24) have p
 riority for this workshop.\nThis program will be taking place in the\nFoun
 der's Room\n\,\nlocated on the first floor (past the staircase\, down the 
 hallway to the right).\n----\nThis workshop is part of the Youth for Entre
 preneurship program led by the YMCA of Greater Toronto. Through hands-on s
 essions\, you’ll gain the digital tools\, financial knowledge\, and crea
 tive strategies needed to build a business idea from the ground up.
