 y\nPlease note that this event starts at 6:00pm.\n***\nPLAN YOUR VISIT:\nL
 ocation:\nJack Rabinovitch Reading Room\, Toronto Reference Library (789 Y
 onge Street)\, 4th floor\nTime:\nDoors open 6:00pm\, Event starts 7:00pm.\
