DESCRIPTION:This session invites children to explore Korean music and move
 ment in a lively\, participatory setting. Led by Sangah Lee of the Canada 
 Pansori Center\, this program combines traditional Korean singing with exp
 ressive full-body movement\, offering children a dynamic and culturally en
 riching experience.\nAges 6-12. Registration required.
LOCATION:Richview\, Lower Level
