UID:6a22e7e25459385f1bd28372@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us this PA Day at the library for the 45 minute workshop
 \, children will learn how to prepare a classic black sugar milk bubble te
 a\, including decorating and mixing techniques\, as well as the breakdown 
 of core ingredients. A classic lidded cup and straw will be provided to en
 joy the boba as they go!\nAbout the ingredients: A. Sugar\, brown sugar\, 
 molasses\, milk\, tapioca pearls. This is a program that teaches participa
 nts how to prepare a proper Milk Boba\n(*Contains dairy and sugar. No caff
 eine.)\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
 Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be use
 d for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions 
 about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerli
 ne staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toron
 to ON M4W 2G8.
