DESCRIPTION:Join us for bouncing rhymes\, songs and stories in this progra
 m for babies\, birth to 18 months\, and their parents or caregivers. Baby
  Time runs from 10:00 am to 10:30 am. Children\, parents and caregivers a
 re invited to Stay and Play\, from 10:30 am to 12:00 pm.\nParticipants wil
 l be capped at the first 25 families.
