SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Gaming Café
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T190000
UID:6a95bd561c197d11325c2435@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop-in every Monday and Thursday to take part in video games
  and board games! Nintendo Switch and PS5 games available. All games avail
 able on a first come\, first serve basis.\nAll teens are welcome! Drop-in\
 , no registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Yo
 uth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, 
 where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are of
 fered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to fi
