DESCRIPTION:The\nChess Institute of Canada (CIC)\ninvites you to join our 
 Chess for Life program - a fun and engaging chess program designed for sen
 iors of all skill levels.\nWhether you’re a seasoned player or intereste
 d in learning the game - enjoy friendly matches\, sharpen your strategy\, 
