 ece!\nTheme: Christmas\nSupplies will be provided\, including canvas board
 s\, acrylic paints and brushes.\nPlease note that this is not an art class
 . Participants will paint by watching and following a step-by-step tutoria
 l video together.\nRegistration is required. Please register online. Visit
  or call the branch if you need help with registering.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program room 1
