SUMMARY:Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261203T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261203T193000
UID:6aa6f431ab7a8e0037c17e8f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Romance Book Club\, where love stories take cen
 ter stage and every page promises a new adventure of the heart. Whether yo
 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book for the Thurs
 day December 3 meeting is\nRoyal Holiday\nby Jasmine Guillory.\nPlease not
 e that this book club is for individuals 18+.\nDrop in\, no registration r
 equired.
LOCATION:City Hall
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa6f431ab7a8e0037c17e8f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
