SUMMARY:Glow & Fold  The Illuminated Book Tree Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T150000
UID:6a96f2311c197d11325c5f4d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a magical hands-on workshop where creativity meets
  innovation! Transform recycled books into stunning holiday trees using th
 e art of folded book design\, beautifully illuminated with LED lights and 
 simple circuit crafting.\nIn this festive experience\, you’ll learn the 
 basics of electrical concepts while creating a glowing\, eco-friendly deco
 ration to brighten your home. Blending sustainability\, artistry\, and hol
 iday spirit\, this workshop offers a unique opportunity to craft something
  truly special—and take home a handmade piece that shines.\nThis is a Dr
 op-In program for Adults and Seniors.\nNo registration required.\nSpace is
  limited. All materials are provided.
LOCATION:Locke
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a96f2311c197d11325c5f4d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
