UID:6aa9c6a3ab7a8e0037c216a4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a cozy space to work on your knitting project alon
 gside fellow crafters? Curious about learning to knit or crochet but not s
 ure where to start? Join Mimico's Knitting Club! Whether you're a seasoned
  knitter\, an experience crocheter\, or picking up a pair of needles for t
 he first time\, everyone is welcome. Bring your own project to work on or 
 learn a new craft with the support of fellow creatives. Knitting needles\,
  crochet hooks\, yarn and snacks will be available. Drop in.
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9c6a3ab7a8e0037c216a4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
