X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c30ab6b48451fc3c0b0940"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaafe9e4ea230006f345098"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_adults
SUMMARY:Finding Recovery Through Exercise Skills and Hope (FRESH)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T150000
UID:6aaafe9e4ea230006f345098@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This\n program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn
  new skills\, and \nhave fun. It involves peer-led group activities which 
 can include crafts\, games\,\n walking\, yoga\, and more. Meet new folks\
 , build social connections\, and tell us\n about programs and services you
  would like to see in the neighbourhood!\nJoin us at the crafts & games ta
 ble\, or for a community walk (weather permitting).\nVisit with a therapy 
 dog!\nOzzy is here\nSeptember 21 & back in November.\nSnacks and refresh
 ments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be availab
 le at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis
  Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaafe9e4ea230006f345098
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9c6a3ab7a8e0037c216a5"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Adult Knitting Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261221T140000
UID:6aa9c6a3ab7a8e0037c216a5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a cozy space to work on your knitting project alon
 gside fellow crafters? Curious about learning to knit or crochet but not s
 ure where to start? Join Mimico's Knitting Club! Whether you're a seasoned
  knitter\, an experience crocheter\, or picking up a pair of needles for t
 he first time\, everyone is welcome. Bring your own project to work on or 
 learn a new craft with the support of fellow creatives. Knitting needles\,
  crochet hooks\, yarn and snacks will be available. Drop in.
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9c6a3ab7a8e0037c216a5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
