 ith some friends or make new ones in the community while playing Scrabble\
 , Trivial Pursuit\, Snakes & Ladders\, Clue\, Chess\, Checkers\, Backgammo
 n\, Uno\, or whatever Card game you can think of!\nDrop-In\nDates:\nMonday
 \, September 21\, 2026\nMonday\, October 5\, 2026\nMonday\, October 19\, 2
 026\nMonday\, November 2\, 2026\nMonday\, November 16\, 2026\nMonday\, Dec
 ember 7\, 2026\nMonday\, December 21\, 2026
