X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Teens": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab029bd607483003828506d"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_teens
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Video Games
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261225T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261225T190000
UID:6ab029bd607483003828506d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub every Friday to play various video ga
 mes with other teens. The video game consoles that are provided are the PS
 5 and Nintendo Switch.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth H
 ubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where
  helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered
  daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find ou
 t more.
LOCATION:Albion\, Auditorium
